  "details": "Trolls are a big part of just about any social platform and its not suprising to anyone that they are deeply ingrained into the very framework of the platform. To solve vrchats short comings with features to defend against these trolls, people had crashers, mods, all kinda of client applications. Now that these are no longer available to most of the communities horror the majority of these defenses have become null. Now we depend on a feature that has long been disfunctional, the vote to kick. Currently i am in a karaoke world where one person has attempted to crash, block the screen, ear rape, and just about everything ele they could think of and even as the world instance owner with 10 people in I am unable to start a vote kick for no apparent reason. if there are 3 people in the world you should be able to start a vote to kick. the block button just isnt as effective anymore. let us remove them",
